  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project integrates this job readiness with environmental advocacy. The project aims to build long-term socio-economic resilience and adaptive capacity to climate change, contributing to both Jordan&#x2019;s green economy and its social inclusiveness. The ultimate goal is to foster sustainable change by improving the well-being and resilience of marginalizedgroups, enabling them to thrive in a changing climate while also promoting sustainabledevelopment across their communities.</narrative>
